sequenceDiagram
    participant E as Environment Server<br/>环境编排 · FastAPI
    participant R as Resources Server<br/>任务与评分 · FastAPI
    participant A as Agent Server<br/>适配层 · FastAPI
    participant S as 任务 sandbox<br/>provider 提供运行环境
    participant M as Model Server<br/>模型代理 · FastAPI

    Note over R,S: Provider 示例： OpenSandbox HTTP(S), OpenShell gRPC,<br/>Docker CLI, Local subprocess
    E->>R: HTTP/JSON: POST /seed_session
    R->>S: Provider API/CLI：创建、执行、上传
    R-->>E: HTTP/JSON: SandboxAccess
    E->>A: HTTP/JSON: POST /v1/agent_sessions
    A->>S: Provider exec/files：复用或安装 runtime
    E->>A: HTTP/JSON: POST .../v1/responses
    A->>S: Provider upload + exec：写入输入，启动 supervisor
    loop 模型与工具调用
        S->>M: HTTP/JSON: POST .../v1/chat/completions
        M-->>S: HTTP/JSON：模型返回
        S->>S: SDK / 本地子进程：执行工具
    end
    A->>S: Provider exec：停止并确认进程树已清理
    S-->>A: Provider download：cleanup.json（清理记录）
    A->>S: Provider download：收集输出与观测记录
    S-->>A: 文件内容：harness JSON 与产物
    A-->>E: HTTP/JSON：Responses API 结果
    E->>A: HTTP/JSON: POST /v1/agent_sessions/close
    A->>S: Provider exec + disconnect：释放借用会话
    A-->>E: HTTP/JSON：关闭结果与观测记录
    E->>R: HTTP/JSON: POST /verify
    Note over R,S: SWE-Pro：导出 patch，停止任务 sandbox A，<br/>再在新 sandbox B 内评分（未画出）
    R-->>E: HTTP/JSON：reward 与评分证据
    E->>R: HTTP/JSON: POST /close_session
    R->>S: Provider API/CLI：停止仍然存在的 sandbox
